1. Definitions

"Software" means the source code, object code, documentation and other material in this repository, and
any work based on it, including modified versions, forks and ports.

"Extension" means a separate work that works with the Software only through the ways the Software offers
for extending it, such as plugins, scripts, game data, content packs, user interface themes and skins, and
that does not contain the Software or a substantial part of it.

"You" means the person or organization exercising rights under this License.

