3. Conditions

  a. No sale. You may not sell, rent or license the Software for a fee, charge for copies of it or for
     access to its source code, or include it in a product or bundle that is sold. Every copy You
     distribute, modified or not, must be available free of charge.
  b. Game servers. Operating a game server built with the Software does not count as selling it. You
     may charge the players of Your server, for example through donations, subscriptions or in-game
     shops, as long as You do not charge for the Software itself.
  c. Extensions. You own the Extensions You write and may license and sell them on any terms You choose,
     as long as they do not include the Software or a substantial part of it.
  d. Notices. Every copy You distribute must include this License and keep the copyright notices. A
